  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 220°C/200°C fan-forced. Bring a medium saucepan of lightly salted water to the boil.\n• Cut cauliflower into small florets (including the stalk!). Cut carrot into half-moons.\n• Place cauliflower and carrot on the lined oven tray.\n• Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat and roast until tender, 20-25 mins.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61e4e66c1659e25fef12ad87/step-abfed9f0.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, peel potato and cut into 2cm chunks.\n• Cook potato in the boiling water until easily pierced with a knife, 10-15 mins.\n• Drain and return to saucepan. Add butter, milk and a generous pinch of salt and mash until smooth.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61e4e66c1659e25fef12ad87/step-f71d2a36.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop brown onion and garlic. Drain and rinse black beans.\n• In a large frying pan heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook onion until softened, 4-5 mins.\n• Stir in black beans, garlic, curry spice blend and tomato paste and cook until fragrant, 1 min. Add the water, vegetable stock, spinach leaves and roasted veggies and cook until thickened, 1 min.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61e4e66c1659e25fef12ad87/step-50626bef.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Preheat grill to high. Transfer black bean mixture to a baking dish and top with potato mash. Sprinkle with Cheddar cheese.\n• Grill until lightly golden, 5-7 mins.\n• Divide Indian cauliflower and black bean pie between plates.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61e4e66c1659e25fef12ad87/step-645424e9.jpg"
    }
  ]
